 "remarks": "Welcome to 2 Putnam Hill, Unit 1A where comfort meets convenience. This beautifully maintained 2 bedroom, 1.1 bath home offers effortless first floor living. The open floor plan creates a seamless flow between living and dining spaces, perfect for both everyday living and entertaining. The second bedroom is currently configured as a home office, providing flexibility for today's lifestyle. Enjoy your own private retreat on the oversized balcony, complete with an awning for added comfort. Convenient to downtown Greenwich, including shops, restaurants, and the train. Enjoy the best of both worlds with privacy, space, and an unbeatable location all wrapped into one exceptional unit.",
